{"id":"samostoyatel_no","lemma":"самостоятельно","pos":"adv","rank":1724,"glosses":["independently, solo","by oneself, without assistance, on one's own, self-sufficiently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я всегда делаю это самостоятельно.","en":"I always do that by myself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264409","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Думаю, мы можем сделать это самостоятельно.","en":"I think we can do this by ourselves.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу сделать это самостоятельно.","en":"I can't do it alone.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я бы лучше сделал это самостоятельно.","en":"I'd rather do it myself.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Ты можешь решить эту проблему самостоятельно?","en":"Can you solve the problem by yourself?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to solve, to settle"},null,null,null]}]}